# Server only. Contact form sends from/to contato@sidecode.com.br.
# Verify sidecode.com.br in Resend. Use a sending-only, domain-scoped production key.
# Never put this value in NEXT_PUBLIC_*, source code, reports or screenshots.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Newsletter collection is paused in both UI and API. No env flag re-enables it.
# Reactivation requires a reviewed consent, retention and unsubscribe workflow.
# Public, official social profiles. Leave blank until the URLs are approved.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SIDE_INSTAGRAM_URL=https://www.instagram.com/codebyside/
NEXT_PUBLIC_SIDE_LINKEDIN_URL=https://www.linkedin.com/company/codebyside/
